init -1 python:
    dsh_tagged_strings = {
        '{w=0.7}"I\'ll repeat what I did. I was the first to leave the attic, and I went to the second floor. I spent several minutes there, during which I heard the elevator once."{w}\n\n"Then, Erina\'s voice echoed to me, but it was very muddled. All I recognized was "Don\'t lie! It can only be you. You killed them.""{w}\n\n"I ran down the staircase and found her dead. I didn\'t see or hear anyone else, so I ran back up to find you all."': '{w=0.7}「我再说一遍我做了什么。我第一个离开阁楼，去了二楼。在那里待了几分钟，其间听到过一次电梯的动静。」{w}\n\n「后来，Erina 的声音传了过来，但很模糊。我只听清了『别撒谎！只可能是你。是你杀了他们。』」\n\n「我顺着楼梯跑下去，发现她已经死了。我没看见也没听见其他人，于是又跑上来找你们。」',
        '{w=0.4}"Right. He found me first since I was on the third floor. I left the attic later than him and walked through the floors until I stayed on the third."{w}\n\n"I just wanted to be alone for a bit, but I didn\'t feel like staying put somewhere. However, I ended up spending the most time on the third floor, where I heard the elevator. I spent some time in the offices and some outside."{w}\n\n"Some minutes later, Atsuki came running from below."': '{w=0.4}「对。我在三楼，所以他先找到了我。我比他晚离开阁楼，一路走过几层，最后停在了三楼。」{w}\n\n「我只是想一个人待一会儿，又不想一直守在同一个地方。结果三楼成了我待得最久的地方，我就是在那里听见电梯的。我先在办公室里待了一阵，又到外面待了一阵。」{w}\n\n「几分钟后，Atsuki 从楼下跑了上来。」',
        '{w=0.4}"I don\'t think accomplices came into play, because it seems like Erina was killed after she accused someone of being the culprit. However, since you and Atsuki know each other, he could be covering for you."{w}\n\n"Also, if you took the elevator with Erina and Isla, you could\'ve used it to reach the third floor after killing her and sent it back to the crystal floor from there."{w}\n\n"Remember when we sent it from the sixth floor to the crystal floor? We heard no noise. If at that point, Atsuki was already running down the staircase, he might not have heard you. Did you check the elevator when you found Erina?"': '{w=0.4}「我不认为有共犯。Erina 是在指认凶手之后才被杀的。不过，你和 Atsuki 彼此认识，他有可能在替你遮掩。」{w}\n\n「还有，如果你和 Erina、Isla 一起乘了电梯，你完全可以在杀了她之后坐电梯去三楼，再把电梯送回水晶层。」{w}\n\n「还记得我们从六楼把电梯送到水晶层那回吗？我们什么都没听见。如果那时 Atsuki 已经在往楼下跑，他也许就听不到你的动静。你发现 Erina 的时候，检查过电梯吗？」',
        '{w=0.4}"Yes. That\'s because when I left the attic, only Erina, Isla, and Akaro remained. Everyone else had already left."{w}\n\n"I looked everywhere to see who had left, and I also opened the elevator in the attic, as I thought of using it. However, I ended up walking out through the main door. Only Akaro could\'ve taken the elevator with Erina and Isla."': '{w=0.4}「能。因为我离开阁楼时，留在里面的只剩 Erina、Isla 和 Akaro，其他人都已经走了。」{w}\n\n「我把各处看了一遍，确认谁已经离开，还打开了阁楼的电梯，因为我当时想过要乘它。可最后我还是从正门走了出去。能和 Erina、Isla 一起乘电梯的，只可能是 Akaro。」',
        '{w=0.4}"Precisely. That\'s where I was the entire time."{w}\n\n"In the attic, I spent a few minutes in one of the bedrooms with Akaro. Soon, I noticed some people had left, so I checked to see who remained."{w}\n\n"I was a bit angry people were entering and leaving the attic without my consent, so I went to find the people who had left."{w}\n\n"However, I reached the fifth floor and recalled the two dead bodies. Most importantly, that a killer was around. That\'s what made me stop."{w}\n\n"I had thousands of things to think about, and that\'s what I did. I went over the incident to see if there was any conclusion I could get to, but ultimately, I didn\'t move from there. I heard the elevator once, which was the only sound that reached my ears until you guys came."': '{w=0.4}「正是。我一直在那里。」{w}\n\n「在阁楼时，我和 Akaro 在其中一个房间里待了几分钟。不久我发觉有人离开了，就去确认还剩哪些人。」{w}\n\n「有人不经我允许就在阁楼里进进出出，我有些恼火，便去找那些离开的人。」{w}\n\n「可走到五楼，我又想起了那两具尸体，更重要的是，想起了凶手还在附近。我因此停下了脚步。」{w}\n\n「我要想的事太多了，就站在那里想。我把整件事从头到尾过了一遍，看能不能得出什么结论，但最终一步也没有挪。其间我听到过一次电梯的声音，那也是你们赶来之前我听到的唯一声响。」',
        '{w=0.4}"That\'s fine by me, and I can confirm it: he\'s telling the truth."{w}\n\n"The reason why I stayed on the fourth floor was different from everyone else\'s. It was because I quickly began to hear noise coming from the floor above me. More specifically, footsteps that I now know belonged to Katei."{w}\n\n"I paid attention to see if there was anything I could figure out from them, but they simply kept going in circles, so it gave the impression that whoever was walking above me was either lost in thought or fairly nervous."{w}\n\n"For most of the time, the sound of footsteps came directly from the third partition. However, during the last few minutes, they left it and started to come from outside the offices."{w}\n\n"When I heard the elevator, I thought the person above me would come down. That never happened, though, and the footsteps never ceased. There was no time for Katei to do anything."': '{w=0.4}「我没意见，而且我可以作证：他说的是实话。」{w}\n\n「我留在四楼的理由和各位不同：我很快就听见楼上传来动静，准确地说，是脚步声——现在我知道那是 Katei 的。」{w}\n\n「我留心去听，想从中听出些什么，可那脚步声只是来回打转，给人的感觉是，楼上那个人不是在出神，就是相当紧张。」{w}\n\n「大部分时间里，脚步声都直接从第三个隔间那边传来。不过在最后几分钟，它离开了那里，开始从办公室外传来。」{w}\n\n「听到电梯时，我以为楼上的人会下来。可那人始终没下来，脚步声也一直没停。Katei 根本没有时间做别的事。」',
        '{w=0.4}"Yes, but I don\'t have much to say. I left the attic when Erina and Isla were still sitting on the sofa. I\'m pretty sure Katei is right and they were the two people remaining in the attic."{w}\n\n"I knew most people had left, but the sixth floor was completely desolate. I also had quite a few things to think about, so I eventually sat where you found me and spent the whole time there. I actually didn\'t hear the elevator, but I was pretty far from it and not paying much attention."': '{w=0.4}「明白，不过我也没什么好说的。我离开阁楼时，Erina 和 Isla 还坐在沙发上。我想 Katei 说得没错，留在阁楼里的就是她们两个。」{w}\n\n「我知道大多数人都走了，六楼又空荡荡的。我也有不少事要想，最后就坐在你们找到我的地方，一直待到你们来。其实我没听见电梯的声音，不过我离得远，也没怎么留意。」',
        '{w=0.4}"I know what you\'re all thinking—I could\'ve gone to the crystal floor with Erina and Isla. Of course, Isla could verify that didn\'t happen, but even if I\'d managed to make it to the crystal floor, I couldn\'t have been found on the sixth."{w}\n\n"According to Sai, Katei spent the last few minutes outside the offices, one floor below me. So if I\'d killed Erina, I needed to either use the elevator or walk up to reach the sixth floor. Doing that without being found or heard would\'ve been impossible."': '{w=0.4}「我知道你们在想什么——我可能和 Erina、Isla 一起去了水晶层。当然，Isla 可以证明没这回事；可就算我真到了水晶层，也不可能在六楼被发现。」{w}\n\n「按 Sai 的说法，最后几分钟 Katei 一直在办公室外，就在我下面一层。那么，如果是我杀了 Erina，我要么坐电梯，要么走楼梯上六楼。无论哪种，都不可能不被人看见或听见。」',
        '{w=0.4}"Is that it, then? Was Atsuki right? None of us could\'ve done it?"{w}\n\n"I\'m not sure I can think of a way out that doesn\'t involve the Sekimeiya. We\'ll get there, though."': '{w=0.4}「那就是这样了？Atsuki 说对了？我们当中谁都做不到？」{w}\n\n「不借助 Sekimeiya 的话，我一时想不出别的解释。不过总会弄明白的。」',
        '{w=0.4}"You could have. Erina and Isla used the elevator alone, from the attic. However, they got off on floor 4 or 5, where you two were. That way, you could\'ve gotten to the crystal floor with a single elevator trip."{w}\n\n"I don\'t mean to say I believe it to be the case, but I\'m answering what you asked. Then, you could\'ve taken the elevator back up while Atsuki and I were on the crystal floor, which we wouldn\'t have heard."': '{w=0.4}「有可能。Erina 和 Isla 从阁楼单独乘了电梯，但她们在四楼或五楼——也就是你们两人所在的地方——下了电梯。这样，你们乘一趟电梯就能到水晶层。」{w}\n\n「我不是说我相信事情就是这样，只是在回答你的问题。然后，趁 Atsuki 和我在水晶层的时候，你们可以再乘电梯上去，我们不会听见。」',
        "That wasn't the end for them.\n{color=#000}But only the final step was left.{/color}": '对他们来说，这还不是终点。\n{color=#000}剩下的，只有最后一步。{/color}',
        "That wasn't the end for them.\nBut only the final step was left.": '对他们来说，这还不是终点。\n剩下的，只有最后一步。',
