        "How could that goal be achieved?\nShiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words.\n{color=#000}Miiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?{/color}": '那个目标要如何才能实现？\nShiroya 一面等着 Atsuki 开口，一面思索着。\n{color=#000}那个在塔里被人看到的 Miiya……她究竟要怎么救？{/color}',
        "How could that goal be achieved?\nShiroya wondered that as she awaited Atsuki's next words.\nMiiya, who had been seen in the tower... How would she be saved?": '那个目标要如何才能实现？\nShiroya 一面等着 Atsuki 开口，一面思索着。\n那个在塔里被人看到的 Miiya……她究竟要怎么救？',
        "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\n{color=#000}But a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\nShe'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds.{/color}": '这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n{color=#000}可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n在两个世界之间真正做出抉择……她从不相信这能做到。{/color}',
        "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\nBut a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\n{color=#000}She'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds.{/color}": '这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n{color=#000}她从不相信……自己真的能在两个世界之间做出抉择。{/color}',
        "Shiroya had thought about it for countless hours.\nBut a way to save Miiya had always meant her own death.\nShe'd never believed it had been possible... to truly decide between the two worlds.": '这件事，Shiroya 已经想了无数个钟头。\n可要救 Miiya，代价从来都是她自己的性命。\n她从不相信……自己真的能在两个世界之间做出抉择。',
        "Would Atsuki come with her?\n{color=#000}If they abandoned their world together, maybe it would be bearable.\nBut she soon learned that he wouldn't.\nAnd that, though it had seemed impossible, there had always been a path toward a desirable outcome.{/color}": 'Atsuki 会和她一起走吗？\n{color=#000}倘若两人一同舍弃自己的世界，或许还能承受。\n但她很快便知道，他不会。\n而她也明白了，尽管看似毫无可能，通往理想结局的路其实一直都在。{/color}',
