        "Because it might reveal your lie. Let's say you traveled from 12:10. It's possible the time displayed would now be something like 12:20.": '因为它也许能揭穿你的谎话。{w}假设你是从 {time=12:10.} 穿越过来的，那表上现在显示的时间很可能就是 {time=12:20.} 之类。',
        "Because it might reveal your lie.{w} Let's say you traveled from 12:10 p.m. It's possible the time displayed would now be something like 12:20 p.m.": '因为它也许能揭穿你的谎话。{w}假设你是从 {time=12:10.} 穿越过来的，那表上现在显示的时间很可能就是 {time=12:20.} 之类。',
        "Because it might reveal your lie. Let's say you traveled from 12:10 p.m. It's possible the time displayed would now be something like 12:20 p.m.": '因为它也许能揭穿你的谎话。{w}假设你是从 {time=12:10.} 穿越过来的，那表上现在显示的时间很可能就是 {time=12:20.} 之类。',
        "I see. That would reveal that I've come from the future. It's a smart idea. I even said earlier that my time matches the computer's, didn't I?": '原来如此。那样就能看出我是从未来来的。这主意很聪明。{w}我先前还说过，我的时间和电脑上的一致，对吧？',
        "...You did. If your time's ahead, you time traveled. If it's the same, it's possible that the body you appear with is identical to how it was at that point in time. That would help us confirm what happened with the second Naomi.": '……你确实说过。{w}如果你的时间超前，那你就是穿越了。如果时间相同，那也许你出现时的身体和那个时间点上的身体完全一致。这能帮我们弄清第二个 Naomi 身上发生的事。',
        '...What? Did you just do this?': '……什么？{w}这是你刚才弄的？',
        "...You know, remember upstairs, in the attic? I looked through a few drawers and found a bunch of useless junk. I believe I might've seen a compatible battery somewhere.": '……{w}说起来，你还记得楼上的阁楼吗？{w}我翻过几个抽屉，里面全是没用的杂物。我好像在哪见过能配上的电池。',
        "This watch doesn't receive the time from a satellite. You sounded pretty convincing earlier when you said that you didn't know how to edit the time. Maybe you just didn't foresee this at all and the battery actually stopped working. If the battery ran out when the displayed time was, say, {time=12:10}, it could pick up from there when we put in a new one—watches like that exist. Also, this watch was working just earlier, when you said it was {time=11:36.} Let's see what happens when we insert a new battery.": '这块表不是靠卫星对时的。你刚才说自己不会调时间，听起来倒挺像那么回事。也许你根本没料到这一步，电池是真的耗尽了。{w}如果电池耗尽时，表上显示的是 {time=12:10} 这样的时间，那换上新电池后，它可能会从那里继续走——市面上确实有这种表。而且，刚才你说时间是 {time=11:36.} 的时候，这块表还在正常走着。我们换上电池，看看会怎么样。',
