        "I went to look at the computer's time, which read 12:18 p.m.{w} I sat on the chair and sighed in exasperation for a few seconds. There were plenty of things to think about, but instead my mind went to something that continued to gnaw at me.": '我去看了一眼电脑上的时间，上面显示 {time=12:18.}{w} 我在椅子上坐下，懊恼地叹了好一会儿气。该想的事多得是，我的思绪却偏偏飘向那件一直耿耿于怀的事。',
