        "No sunlight was left. I approached my phone and glanced at the time.{w} 7:19 p.m. The previous day, I'd gone to sleep very early, so my body was demanding that I repeat the schedule.": '外面已经没有日光。我走到手机旁看了一眼时间。{w}{time=19:19.} 前一天我睡得很早，身体似乎正催着我照同样的作息再来一遍。',
        "No sunlight was left. I approached my phone and glanced at the time. 7:19 p.m. The previous day, I'd gone to sleep very early, so my body was demanding that I repeat the schedule.": '外面已经没有日光。我走到手机旁看了一眼时间。{w}{time=19:19.} 前一天我睡得很早，身体似乎正催着我照同样的作息再来一遍。',
        "I have to go to the tower tomorrow, don't I...? That'll tell me which options I have. Assuming I'm able to find the cabinet, what would I choose? If I can't decide now, how will I be able to decide tomorrow?": '明天我必须去塔里，对吧……？去了就能知道我有哪些选择。{w}假如我真能找到展示柜，我该选什么？现在都决定不了，明天又怎么可能决定得了？',
        "I was so comfortable in my bed that it was almost impossible to believe that, within a few hours, I might have been living in a world where I wouldn't really be myself. Instead, I could end up in a prison cell. The choices I had weren't just freeing, they were daunting.": '躺在床上的舒适感让我几乎无法相信，再过几个小时，自己也许就会活在一个不再真正是自己的世界里。{w}又或者，最终落得身陷牢房的下场。眼前的选择固然让我感到自由，却也令人望而生畏。',
        "...If I changed the past, I would pretty much be sacrificing myself. It's already changed in a very minor way, but that might not matter. Even if I can't ever use the Sekimeiya again, if I simply prevent Atsuki and myself from going to the tower on the 15th, the other version of me will never travel through time, so both of us will persist. ...That is assuming I don't get dematerialized by a paradox. Since the past can be changed, I should probably not be worried about that. Hopefully.": '……{w}如果我改变过去，就等于牺牲我自己。过去确实已经发生了很细微的改变，不过那也许无关紧要。{w}就算我再也用不了 Sekimeiya，只要阻止 Atsuki 和我在15号去塔里，另一个我就不会去穿越时间，两个我都能继续存在。{w}……前提是我不会被悖论抹消。既然过去可以改变，我大概不必担心这一点。但愿如此。',
        "The time was {time=7:45.} I set the phone back on the table while a glimpse of the dream I'd just had returned to me.": '时间已是{time=7:45.}{w}我把手机放回桌上，方才梦中的些许片段又浮上心头。',
        "The time was 7:45.{w} I set the phone back on the table while a glimpse of the dream I'd just had returned to me.": '时间已是{time=7:45.}{w}我把手机放回桌上，方才梦中的些许片段又浮上心头。',
