        "Exactly. This means that if you put all the gems there into a case, you won't be seen. We would usually never do this, as it makes you the only suspect, but this isn't an issue this time. The curtains aren't raised until 9:10 a.m., so you'll leave all of them down. You'll also leave the case in the room, in the corner beneath the camera, so that we can have a visitor be there when the smoke is released, crouching right as it happens. If they keep their head near the floor as they exit the tower with the case, they won't fall unconscious. Two minutes after the smoke has been released, he will attempt to flee. This will make Ashiya think their expectations were subverted and that the failed attack had that room as its final target. ...I doubt Faiten will be willing to take this job under any circumstances, but I'll find the right person without telling them the full extent of the plan.": '正是如此。也就是说，只要你把那里的宝石全装进箱子，就不会被拍到。平时我们绝不会这么做，因为那样你就成了唯一的嫌疑人，但这次没关系。{w} 遮布要到 {time=9:10} 才会拉起，所以你要让它们一直垂着。你还要把箱子留在那个房间里，放在摄像头下方的角落。这样烟雾释放时，我们可以安排一名访客正好在场，并在那一刻蹲下。只要他带着箱子离开塔时把头贴近地面，就不会昏过去。{w} 烟雾释放两分钟后，他会尝试逃走。这会让芦屋以为他们的预想落空了，以为那场失败的袭击最终针对的其实是那个房间。{w} ……我怀疑 Faiten 无论如何都不肯接这活，但我会找到合适的人，并且不把计划的全部内容告诉他。',
        "Yes. Before, I said that infecting the computer again could be risky. While that is true, it won't be an issue if we take the proper measures. When the smoke is released, I will infect the computer remotely. While Katei is overwhelmed by the attack, it'll take me a few seconds to erase the saved footage of the previous 24 hours. Then, I will immediately disconnect our access so that we can't be tracked. This will work in four different ways. It will remove the footage that incriminates Ido. It will remove the footage showing the source of the smoke in the event room. It will make them think we had to remove the hallways' footage to hide who placed the grenades there, when that's not actually needed. And lastly, it will hide that we can access the computer at any time, because they might think we were able to erase the footage thanks to the commotion of the attack. ...This is it. This is what we'll do, and how we'll nab the Sekimeiya.": '是的。{w} 我之前说过，再次侵入电脑可能有风险。确实如此，但只要措施得当，就不会出问题。{w} 烟雾释放时，我会远程侵入电脑。趁 Katei 被袭击弄得手忙脚乱，我只要几秒钟就能抹掉过去 24 小时的录像。然后我会立刻断开我们的访问，让他们无法追踪。{w} 这会起到四个作用。{w} 删掉会让 Ido 暴露的录像。{w} 删掉显示活动室烟雾来源的录像。{w} 让他们以为我们必须删掉走廊录像来隐藏放置烟雾弹的人，而实际上那并非必要。{w} 最后，还能掩盖我们可以随时访问电脑这一点，因为他们可能会以为，我们是趁袭击造成的混乱才删掉录像的。{w} ……就是这样。这就是我们的做法，也是我们夺得 Sekimeiya 的办法。',
        "Once the plan is a success, we'll get it out of the building with the cart. However, how do we let Ashiya know their Sekimeiya is fake? Whatever the best answer is, it relies on the crafting process. You said the Sekimeiya's kept pretty cold. There aren't many chemical reactions that occur at low temperatures, but perhaps we could make use of one to damage the Sekimeiya after a couple of days of exposure. If not, then a mere timed reaction would suffice, one that would break our Sekimeiya and leave behind a card with our name.": '计划成功后，我们就用推车把它运出大楼。可是，怎么让芦屋知道他们的 Sekimeiya 是赝品？不管最终用哪种办法，关键都在制作工艺。{w} 你说过，Sekimeiya 存放的环境相当冷。低温下能发生的化学反应不多，但也许我们可以利用其中一种，让 Sekimeiya 在暴露于常温几天后受损。{w} 如果不行，单纯的定时反应也够了——让我们的 Sekimeiya 碎裂，并留下一张写有我们名号的卡片。',
        "When Katei saw the busy waveform, he knew his bait had been effective. Since Xyn had attacked the gem shop, Ido hadn't spoken to his boss. Katei had wanted to know Xyn's position after their failure, so he had given Ido information about the Sekimeiya to report to his group.": '看到那密集的波形时，Katei 就知道自己的诱饵奏效了。{w} 自从 Xyn 袭击宝石店后，Ido 一直没和上司说过话。Katei 想知道 Xyn 在失败后的动向，于是把关于 Sekimeiya 的情报交给 Ido，让他转告自己的组织。',
        "At a low volume, he listened to the audio in his dim office. The second time, the conversation was a lot more substantial. Katei thrilled internally; an overwhelming amount of details were being revealed to him. He finally knew many of Xyn's secrets that had tormented him for so long. He heard Xyn design their plan, even though the end sounded muffled. Ashiya's lure wouldn't work; there would be no attack before the 15th, and most importantly, Katei could no longer follow through with his scheme. Xyn would attack during the daytime. The alarm wouldn't be activated, and Katei's voice could be heard by other people. In addition, even if the alarm was activated, Katei wouldn't be able to offer a Xyn member a quick escape, as the outside of the building wouldn't be deserted.": '他把音量调得很低，在昏暗的办公室里听着录音。第二次，对话内容充实了许多。{w} Katei 内心一阵狂喜；无数细节正展现在他面前。他终于知道了 Xyn 的许多秘密——这些秘密折磨了他那么久。{w} 他听见 Xyn 在敲定计划，尽管结尾部分听起来含混不清。芦屋的诱饵不会奏效；15 日之前不会有袭击，而最重要的是，Katei 再也无法按自己的计划行事。{w} Xyn 会在白天发动袭击。警报不会启动，而其他人可能会听见 Katei 的声音。此外，就算警报启动，Katei 也无法帮 Xyn 成员迅速脱身，因为大楼外不会空无一人。',
        "However, there was something else Katei realized: Xyn were right. The Sekimeiya's value was already much higher than what Ashiya had expected. To incentivize Xyn's attack, Ashiya had been building an air of mystery around the gemstone, which had rapidly expanded. Until the 15th, the Sekimeiya's worth would be far higher than everything else Ashiya had ever possessed. Katei didn't feel pressured. He had very valuable information, and he had learned that the concept of his plan could still be executed, albeit differently. He could anonymously threaten Ido with the audio, but that would give away Katei's source of information, and unlike after his previous plan, Xyn wouldn't be indebted to him. As such, he decided to change his way of thinking for the time being.": '不过，Katei 还意识到了另一件事：Xyn 说得对。Sekimeiya 的价值早已远超芦屋的预期。{w} 为了诱使 Xyn 出手，芦屋一直在给这颗宝石营造神秘气氛，而这种气氛迅速膨胀。到 15 日为止，Sekimeiya 的价值会远远高过芦屋拥有过的任何东西。{w} Katei 并不觉得有压力。他掌握了极有价值的情报，也明白了自己计划的构想仍可实行，只是方式要变。他可以用录音匿名威胁 Ido，但那会暴露 Katei 的情报来源；而且与上次计划之后不同，Xyn 不会因此欠他人情。于是，他决定暂且改变思路。',
        "The Sekimeiya... he could obtain it himself and postpone the idea of blackmailing Xyn. He had the key to the cabinet and a trump card he'd saved for years—the storeroom's secret. Before Katei's parents had died, the building had undergone severe expansions. The secret corridor had always remained a hidden part of the lowest floor, but nobody who knew about it remained. Naturally, Katei had tested it already to deduce whether Xyn were aware of its existence. He had easily been able to confirm it had never opened during their attacks.": 'Sekimeiya……他可以亲自拿到它，把勒索 Xyn 的念头暂时搁下。他手里有展示柜的钥匙，还有一张藏了多年的王牌——储藏室的秘密。{w} 在 Katei 的父母去世之前，这栋大楼经历过大规模扩建。那条秘密通道一直是底层不为人知的一部分，但知道它的人已经都不在了。{w} 当然，Katei 已经试探过，想推断 Xyn 是否知道它的存在。他很容易就确认，在 Xyn 的历次袭击中，那条通道从未被打开过。',
        "How could Katei take the Sekimeiya out of the tower? Despite all he knew, it wasn't a simple task. He couldn't act out a fake Xyn attack when he didn't have the night shift: if he entered through the storeroom, he would be seen from the security room. He could take action when he had the night shift. He could bring the Sekimeiya to the storeroom and claim Xyn had erased the security footage. But would such a thing be believable? He wasn't worried that Xyn could threaten him anymore—he had the upper hand in that battle, as he could expose a good deal about them. Yet, Katei's story would be too convenient. His alarm would have to be somehow bypassed, and Katei would have to let them escape.": 'Katei 要怎么把 Sekimeiya 带出塔？尽管他知道这么多，这仍不是件容易的事。{w} 不值夜班时，他无法伪造一场 Xyn 的袭击：如果他从储藏室进去，就会被监控室看到。{w} 他可以在值夜班时动手。他可以把 Sekimeiya 带到储藏室，声称 Xyn 删掉了监控录像。可这种说法会有人信吗？{w} 他已经不再担心 Xyn 能威胁自己——在这场较量中他占了上风，因为他能揭发 Xyn 的许多事。可是，Katei 的说法会显得太过凑巧。警报总得被绕过，而且 Katei 还得放他们逃走。',
        "What if he activated the alarm by forcing open the cabinet? Then, when the exit unlocked, no Xyn member would be found in the building, and the Sekimeiya would've magically disappeared. There was only one way Katei could make that work: by saying he had seen someone escaping toward the storeroom. However, he didn't want to reveal the existence of the hidden door yet. There was no smooth story that let Katei weasel out. He didn't want to be investigated by Ashiya or Xyn, but every scenario sounded iffy and had him as an easy suspect. That was until he realized that the perfect moment existed. A moment where he wouldn't be the only suspect, and where his story would be believed without doubt: the day of the event.": '如果他用强行打开展示柜的方式触发警报呢？那么出口解锁时，楼里不会找到任何 Xyn 成员，而 Sekimeiya 则会像变魔术一样消失。{w} 要让这套说法成立，Katei 只有一个办法：声称自己看见有人朝储藏室方向逃走了。但他还不想暴露暗门的存在。{w} 没有哪套说辞能让 Katei 顺利脱身。他不想被芦屋或 Xyn 调查，可每一种情形都漏洞百出，让他很容易成为嫌疑人。{w} 直到他意识到，完美的时机确实存在。{w} 在那个时机里，他不会成为唯一的嫌疑人，而他的说法也会被毫无疑问地采信：活动当天。',
        "The Sekimeiya cabinet had been designed to trigger the alarm upon being minimally damaged. At {time=9:04}, a vast cloud of smoke was going to be released in the event room. Even though the cabinet could be unlocked, the mere damage of the smoke could set off the alarm. In any case, if the alarm went off at that time, it wouldn't be questioned: a real attack would've triggered it, so it would've served its function.": 'Sekimeiya 的展示柜被设计成只要轻微受损就会触发警报。到 {time=9:04}，活动室里将释放出大片烟雾。即使展示柜可以解锁，烟雾本身造成的损伤也可能触发警报。{w} 无论如何，如果警报在那个时候响起，不会有人质疑：真正的袭击本就会触发它，所以它也算尽到了职责。',
        "The Sekimeiya cabinet had been designed to trigger the alarm upon being minimally damaged. At 9:04, a vast cloud of smoke was going to be released in the event room. Even though the cabinet could be unlocked, the mere damage of the smoke could set off the alarm.{w} In any case, if the alarm went off at that time, it wouldn't be questioned: a real attack would've triggered it, so it would've served its function.": 'Sekimeiya 的展示柜被设计成只要轻微受损就会触发警报。到 {time=9:04}，活动室里将释放出大片烟雾。即使展示柜可以解锁，烟雾本身造成的损伤也可能触发警报。{w} 无论如何，如果警报在那个时候响起，不会有人质疑：真正的袭击本就会触发它，所以它也算尽到了职责。',
