        "The Sekimeiya cabinet had been designed to trigger the alarm upon being minimally damaged. At 9:04 a.m., a vast cloud of smoke was going to be released in the event room. Even though the cabinet could be unlocked, the mere damage of the smoke could set off the alarm. In any case, if the alarm went off at that time, it wouldn't be questioned: a real attack would've triggered it, so it would've served its function.": 'Sekimeiya 的展示柜被设计成只要轻微受损就会触发警报。到 {time=9:04}，活动室里将释放出大片烟雾。即使展示柜可以解锁，烟雾本身造成的损伤也可能触发警报。{w} 无论如何，如果警报在那个时候响起，不会有人质疑：真正的袭击本就会触发它，所以它也算尽到了职责。',
        "Katei had designed the system, and he knew Xyn didn't have access to the tower's computer. If he altered the system to automatically activate the alarm at that time, no one would know. He could trap Xyn in the tower and commandeer the rest of their plan himself. In addition, Katei had another reason to trigger the alarm: to aid Xyn before his intervention. The only way their plan could fail was if people from the outside quickly raided the building despite the smoke. That was something the alarm could prevent.": '这套系统是 Katei 设计的，他知道 Xyn 无法访问塔里的电脑。如果他改动系统，让警报在那个时候自动触发，不会有人知道。{w} 他可以把 Xyn 困在塔里，并亲自接管他们计划的剩余部分。此外，Katei 触发警报还有另一个理由：在他介入之前先帮 Xyn 一把。他们的计划唯一可能失败的地方，就是外面的人不顾烟雾迅速冲进大楼。而警报恰好能阻止这种事。',
        "Katei's initial idea was promising, and he could develop it further. Xyn would disable the hallway A cameras, where the security room and the storeroom were. That meant that before the attack, Katei could quickly go to the lobby to discuss what to do during the event with the police. That would be the last recording of hallway A. Upon seeing the smoke, everyone would rapidly evacuate, unaware that the alarm was soon to be activated. Then, during the chaos, Katei would reenter the hallway.": 'Katei 最初的想法很有前景，而且他还能进一步完善。{w} Xyn 会关掉 A走廊的摄像头，而监控室和储藏室都在那边。这意味着，在袭击发生前，Katei 可以迅速去大厅，与警察商量活动期间该如何应对。那会成为 A走廊的最后一段录像。{w} 一看到烟雾，所有人都会迅速疏散，没人知道警报即将启动。随后，在混乱之中，Katei 会重新进入走廊。',
        "That would no longer be caught by the cameras. As he'd heard Xyn's discussion, he knew that by crawling, he would avoid falling unconscious. He knew what Atase's movements would be—the alarm wouldn't influence them. He would go to the cleaning room, so Katei had the opportunity to take the Sekimeiya out of the cabinet if it was unlocked. If it wasn't, he'd go take it from the cleaning cart after Atase finished his job.": '这样便不会再被摄像头拍到。他听过 Xyn 的商议，知道只要匍匐爬行，就能避免失去意识。{w} 他清楚 Atase 的行动会如何展开——警报不会改变那些步骤。Atase 会去清洁间，因此只要展示柜未上锁，Katei 就有机会取出 Sekimeiya。若柜子锁着，他就等 Atase 做完清洁，再从清洁车里取走。',
        "Then, he could rapidly go to the storeroom and leave the Sekimeiya behind the movable wall. Lei had told him it couldn't be kept at a warm temperature, but the storeroom's corridor was colder than the rest of the tower due to its lack of insulation and air conditioning. Lastly, he would leave using his unique key. Everyone would be in front of the entrance, so he wouldn't be seen stepping out of the building. Then, he would appear from behind them, as if he had evacuated, which hallway A's camera would corroborate.": '接着，他可以迅速前往储藏室，把 Sekimeiya 留在可移动墙后面。Lei 告诉过他，Sekimeiya 不能保存在温暖的环境中；储藏室的走廊没有隔热层，也没有空调，因此比塔内其他地方更冷。{w} 最后，他会用自己的专属钥匙离开。所有人都会聚在入口前，所以没人会看见他走出大楼。然后，他会从人群后方现身，仿佛自己也是刚撤离出来，而 A走廊的摄像头会印证这一点。',
        'Everything was finally in motion, and the long wait for the day of the event began. Ashiya, Xyn, and Katei. Each of those three parties had their own unique agenda.': '一切终于开始运转，接下来便是对活动当日的漫长等待。{w}芦屋、Xyn、Katei——三方各有各的盘算。',
        'Meanwhile, Xyn received their replica of the Sekimeiya. Ido, who had seen, touched, and measured the original, confirmed there was no glaring difference between the two, and that unless Ashiya had foreseen a replica being created, it would work.': '与此同时，Xyn 收到了他们制作的 Sekimeiya 仿制品。{w} Ido 见过、摸过并测量过真品，确认两者没有明显差异；除非芦屋早已预料到会有人仿制，否则这件复制品足以奏效。',
        "As the days approached, Ashiya realized Xyn were likely to not fall for their trap, and as Xyn had predicted, the Sekimeiya continued to grow more valuable in the eyes of the world. Ashiya hadn't fully prepared the event yet, so a trusted employee of theirs was chosen to plan out the guided visits.": '随着日期临近，芦屋意识到 Xyn 很可能不会中自己布下的圈套；而正如 Xyn 所料，Sekimeiya 在世人心中的价值持续攀升。{w}芦屋尚未完全准备好活动，于是选了一名信得过的员工来筹划导览参观。',
        "Eight people were trapped in Ashiya Tower, but they weren't alone. That was the catalyst of the construction of a mountainous maze. Who reached its peak? It wasn't everyone who began the climb.": '八个人被困在芦屋塔中，但他们并不孤单。这件事，成了建造一座层叠如山的迷宫的契机。{w} 谁最终登上了峰顶？并非每个开始攀登的人都能登顶。',
        "You are lucky enough to have access to all its sides, but what about the peak? Three parties formed the mountain's base, unaware of how high it would go.": '你足够幸运，能接触到它的每一面，可峰顶呢？{w} 三方构成了这座山的底座，却不知道它会升到多高。',
        'The next person he saw was Ido. Without looking over, he casually made his way to the hallway. It took him a while to come back. When he did, his clothes were different, and he was carrying a cleaning bucket.': '他见到的下一个人是 Ido。Ido 没往他这边看，若无其事地走向走廊。{w} 过了好一阵，Ido 才回来。回来时已换了一身衣服，手里提着清洁桶。',
        "Out of nowhere, Atase felt a sudden wave of heat. ...He had seen the boy before. In Musashi Gemstones, he had been the first to be hit by the smoke. Atsuki Hakutoki was his name, and he'd been safely discharged from the hospital.": '没来由地，Atase 感到一阵燥热。……他见过那个少年。{w} 在武藏宝石，少年是第一个被烟雾波及的人。他叫 Atsuki Hakutoki，后来已平安出院。',
        "...He had to avoid eye contact; the boy next to him had lost someone, and it had been his fault. He had taken a glance at the girl as well. Although he hadn't seen her before, the eyes below her red hair looked identical to the boy's.": '……{w}他不能和对方对上视线；那个少年曾失去过某个人，而那都是他的错。{w} 他也瞥了少女一眼。他从未见过她，可红发下的那双眼睛，和少年一模一样。',
        "{time=9:00} was distant. Long before it, police officers arrived outside the tower. Atase's rough facial description must've been known. He didn't think he'd be recognized, but he couldn't bring himself to look back.": '距离{time=9:00}还早。远在那之前，警察就已抵达塔外。{w} Atase 的大致长相想必早已传开。他觉得自己不会被认出，可还是不敢回头。',
