        "9:00 a.m. was distant. Long before it, police officers arrived outside the tower.{w} Atase's rough facial description must've been known. He didn't think he'd be recognized, but he couldn't bring himself to look back.": '距离{time=9:00}还早。远在那之前，警察就已抵达塔外。{w} Atase 的大致长相想必早已传开。他觉得自己不会被认出，可还是不敢回头。',
        "9:00 a.m. was distant. Long before it, police officers arrived outside the tower. Atase's rough facial description must've been known. He didn't think he'd be recognized, but he couldn't bring himself to look back.": '距离{time=9:00}还早。远在那之前，警察就已抵达塔外。{w} Atase 的大致长相想必早已传开。他觉得自己不会被认出，可还是不敢回头。',
        "All at once, a wave of people flooded in. Faint chatter took over the silence, but none of it reached Atase. He had to look calm and know exactly what to do. He saw someone he knew outside the lobby. However, that person didn't know who Atase was. His job was to take out a suitcase at {time=9:06.}": '忽然间，人潮涌了进来。细碎的交谈声取代了寂静，却没有一句落进 Atase 耳中。他必须显得镇定，而且清楚自己该做什么。{w} 他看见大厅外有个认识的人。可那人并不知道 Atase 是谁。他的任务，是在{time=9:06.}把手提箱取出来。',
        "All at once, a wave of people flooded in. Faint chatter took over the silence, but none of it reached Atase. He had to look calm and know exactly what to do.{w} He saw someone he knew outside the lobby. However, that person didn't know who Atase was. His job was to take out a suitcase at 9:06.": '忽然间，人潮涌了进来。细碎的交谈声取代了寂静，却没有一句落进 Atase 耳中。他必须显得镇定，而且清楚自己该做什么。{w} 他看见大厅外有个认识的人。可那人并不知道 Atase 是谁。他的任务，是在{time=9:06.}把手提箱取出来。',
