        'They were yells that, in reality, nobody ever heard. At 9:04 p.m., the police entered the building. Even though everyone was alive, Suripo was dead on the floor. The officers could hardly believe their eyes while the survivors emerged.': '那些喊声，现实中谁也没有听见。在 {time=21:04}，警察进入了大楼。{w} 尽管所有人都还活着，Suripo 却已倒在地板上，没了气息。幸存者一个个走出来时，警官们几乎不敢相信自己的眼睛。',
        "Of course, though, there's one last thing for you to see. The peak.": '不过，当然，还有最后一样东西等着你去看。{w}{w=0.3} 顶峰。',
        "...Actually, I'm pretty sure the world we were sent to was this very world. Sai asked me how Shiroya got into the tower. For him, she'd never been there.": '……其实，我很确定，我们被送往的世界正是这一个。{w} Sai 问我 Shiroya 是怎么进塔的。对他来说，她根本没来过塔里。',
        '"Instead of answering, he entered the storeroom. Seconds later, he returned."': '「他没有回答，直接走进储藏室。{w} 几秒后，又折返回来。」',
        "That means they'll return here. Just like we came back to our world, they'll come back here. It'll happen before 19:00.": '也就是说，他们会回到这里。就像我们回到了自己的世界一样，他们也会回到这里。而且会发生在 {time=19.} 之前。',
        "That means they'll return here. Just like we came back to our world, they'll come back here. It'll happen before 7 p.m.": '也就是说，他们会回到这里。就像我们回到了自己的世界一样，他们也会回到这里。而且会发生在 {time=19.} 之前。',
        "18:43... That was almost twenty minutes behind the real time I estimated. That made me think that after traveling, Sai's replicated location had been of twenty minutes prior, and his watch hadn't stopped working.": '{time=18:43.}……这比我估算的真实时间慢了将近二十分钟。于是我猜想，Sai 穿越后出现的位置，其实是二十分钟前的位置；而他的手表并没有停走。',
        "6:43 p.m... That was almost twenty minutes behind the real time I estimated. That made me think that after traveling, Sai's replicated location had been of twenty minutes prior, and his watch hadn't stopped working.": '{time=18:43.}……这比我估算的真实时间慢了将近二十分钟。于是我猜想，Sai 穿越后出现的位置，其实是二十分钟前的位置；而他的手表并没有停走。',
        "Now, I'm pretty sure that his watch was a bit more than twenty minutes behind, but it wasn't because he had traveled. It was the Sai from this world, who still had the time wrong from when he'd traveled to the future with the other version of me. Later, when we returned to our world, Sai's time was accurate again, and I figured he must've synced it using the computer.": '现在，我基本确定，他的手表慢了不止二十分钟，但这并不是因为他穿越过，而是因为这个世界的 Sai 曾和另一个我一起穿越到未来，表上的时间从那时起就一直不准。{w} 后来我们回到自己的世界时，他的手表又准了，我猜他一定用电脑校准过。',
        'What now, then? I need to have the Sekimeiya for myself... Am I going to be found? The Sekimeiya are in the attic, so I can probably use the future one to escape from them.': '那现在怎么办？我必须把 Sekimeiya 拿到手……{w} 我会被他们发现吗？Sekimeiya 都在阁楼，我或许能用未来那个逃离他们。',
        '...Are they not planning to keep going?': '……{w}他们不打算继续往上搜了吗？',
        "...Maybe I get it. They don't know that the world around them just changed. Perhaps they just looked through the whole building, ending at the crystal floor. If that's when they changed worlds, they must think that the whole building is empty.": '……{w}也许我明白了。他们不知道周围的世界刚刚切换过。{w}他们可能把整栋楼都搜了一遍，最后搜到水晶层。如果世界就是在那时切换的，他们一定会以为整栋楼已经空了。',
        "We arrived in this world at 19:00. At that time, I'll be able to meet Shiroya again.": '我们是在 {time=19.} 来到这个世界的。到了那时，我就能再次见到 Shiroya。',
        "We arrived in this world at 7 p.m. At that time, I'll be able to meet Shiroya again.": '我们是在 {time=19.} 来到这个世界的。到了那时，我就能再次见到 Shiroya。',
        "She was with us. Her clothes were different, but she was the real one—she had lived through much more than I had imagined. She'll be here at {time=19}, and she'll go to the attic all of a sudden. That's where I'll be.": '她曾和我们在一起。衣着虽然不同，但她才是真正的 Shiroya——她经历的事情远比我预想的多。{w} 她会在 {time=19} 来到这里，然后忽然前往阁楼。我也会在那里。',
        "She was with us. Her clothes were different, but she was the real one—she had lived through much more than I had imagined.{w} She'll be here at 19:00, and she'll go to the attic all of a sudden. That's where I'll be.": '她曾和我们在一起。衣着虽然不同，但她才是真正的 Shiroya——她经历的事情远比我预想的多。{w} 她会在 {time=19} 来到这里，然后忽然前往阁楼。我也会在那里。',
