        "When we took the elevator up, it stopped on the third floor. That was when we returned. That must mean that the third floor was being encompassed by the ranges of both Sekimeiya, and someone activated one. If we're there at that time, I know for a fact we'll be able to return.": '我们坐电梯上去的时候，电梯停在了三楼。我们就是那时回去的。{w}也就是说，当时三楼正处于两个 Sekimeiya 的重叠范围内，而且有人启动了其中一个。只要那时我们在那儿，就一定回得去。',
        'The Past Sekimeiya was on the marble countertop, already white again. By its side was the voice recorder with numbers on its screen. 81:04.': '过去Sekimeiya 就放在大理石台面上，已经重新变回白色。它旁边是录音笔，屏幕上显示着数字。{w} 81:04。',
        '...My heartbeat picked up, causing my fingers to jitter on their own. A thought had suddenly come to me.': '……{w}我的心跳快了起来，手指也不受控制地发颤。一个念头忽然冒了出来。',
        "...It should be simple. I can travel to November 30th one more time. I know saving Miiya is within my reach—she's alive. Then, I have to do what I just thought. I can enter the tower when the 15th comes. I can be in the attic at {time=19}, before Shiroya appears.": '……应该很简单。我可以再穿越到 11 月 30 日一次。我知道救下 Miiya 并非遥不可及——她还活着。{w} 然后，我必须去做刚才想到的事。等 15 日到来，我就能进入塔里。我可以在 {time=19} 就待在阁楼里，赶在 Shiroya 出现之前。',
        "...It should be simple. I can travel to November 30th one more time. I know saving Miiya is within my reach—she's alive.{w} Then, I have to do what I just thought. I can enter the tower when the 15th comes. I can be in the attic at 19:00, before Shiroya appears.": '……应该很简单。我可以再穿越到 11 月 30 日一次。我知道救下 Miiya 并非遥不可及——她还活着。{w} 然后，我必须去做刚才想到的事。等 15 日到来，我就能进入塔里。我可以在 {time=19} 就待在阁楼里，赶在 Shiroya 出现之前。',
