        "...It should be simple. I can travel to November 30th one more time. I know saving Miiya is within my reach—she's alive. Then, I have to do what I just thought. I can enter the tower when the 15th comes. I can be in the attic at 7 p.m., before Shiroya appears.": '……应该很简单。我可以再穿越到 11 月 30 日一次。我知道救下 Miiya 并非遥不可及——她还活着。{w} 然后，我必须去做刚才想到的事。等 15 日到来，我就能进入塔里。我可以在 {time=19} 就待在阁楼里，赶在 Shiroya 出现之前。',
        "According to my estimate, it should've been a little past 16:00. Three hours still remained until 19:00.": '照我的估算，此刻应该刚过{time=16.}，距离{time=19.}还有三个小时。',
        "According to my estimate, it should've been a little past 4 p.m. Three hours still remained until 7 p.m.": '照我的估算，此刻应该刚过{time=16.}，距离{time=19.}还有三个小时。',
        "I could live through November 30th a third time; I could save Miiya, as the news I'd read was the only obstacle in that pursuit. In the world I was in, Shiroya didn't exist, but I had never seen her blood, no definitive proof of her death. Her absence was no real barrier.": '我可以第三次度过十一月三十日，也可以救下 Miiya——毕竟我读到的那则新闻，是这条路上唯一的阻碍。{w}在我此刻所在的世界里，Shiroya 并不存在，但我从未见过她的血，也没有她已死的确证。她的缺席并不能算真正的障碍。',
        'After that, I had to return with Shiroya to our world. The way to accomplish it was by being in the center of the building at close to 19:30.': '之后，我必须带着 Shiroya 回到我们的世界。要做到这一点，就得在快到 {time=19:30} 的时候待在大楼中央。',
        'After that, I had to return with Shiroya to our world. The way to accomplish it was by being in the center of the building at close to 7:30 p.m.': '之后，我必须带着 Shiroya 回到我们的世界。要做到这一点，就得在快到 {time=19:30} 的时候待在大楼中央。',
        "Just before 19:30, Sai had gone to the storeroom to check whether his mark had disappeared. At that time, the door hadn't opened yet.": '就在{time=19:30}之前，Sai 曾去储藏室确认自己的标记是否消失。那时，门还没有打开。',
        "Just before 7:30 p.m., Sai had gone to the storeroom to check whether his mark had disappeared. At that time, the door hadn't opened yet.": '就在{time=19:30}之前，Sai 曾去储藏室确认自己的标记是否消失。那时，门还没有打开。',
        "...I left the attic; I didn't feel comfortable thinking there. If anyone came up with the elevator, I wouldn't hear them, so I chose to go to the sixth floor, where I would hear both the elevator and any approaching footsteps.": '……{w}我离开了阁楼。我总觉得在那里思考不踏实。要是有人乘电梯上来，我根本听不见，于是我选择去六楼——在那里，电梯的动静和任何靠近的脚步声都能传进耳中。',
        "...Of course, my plan implied a future version of myself was in the tower. A version of myself who had been there since the morning. I'd known that, which was why I'd followed the group's movements—so that I could give myself a route to hide throughout the day, aware of where to be at all times.": '……当然，我的计划意味着，未来的我就在这座塔里——一个从早晨起便待在这里的我。{w}这一点我早就清楚，所以才一直留意那群人的动向，好给自己安排一条整日藏身的路线，随时知道该待在何处。',
        "Is it...? Just before the group left this world, the whole building was searched, when I replaced the other Atsuki without anyone noticing. Naturally, my future self wasn't found—that would've been a paradox, as I would've seen myself before knowing where I would be.": '会是这样吗……？{w}在那群人离开这个世界之前，整栋楼都被搜查过——正是在那时，我不动声色地顶替了另一个 Atsuki。未来的我自然没有被发现。若被发现，就会成为悖论：那等于我在得知自己该去何处之前，就先看见了自己。',
        "So, why was that me not found? How will I avoid being found? At the time, every single place was inspected except for the hidden area in the storeroom. However, I couldn't have been there, as my own past self already was.": '那么，那个我为什么没被找到？我又要怎样才能不被找到？{w}当时，除了储藏室里那处隐蔽的空间，每一处都被查过了。可我不可能待在那里——过去的我已经占着那个位置了。',
        "My future self merely has to be here at {time=19:30.} ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at {time=14.} My past self was in the storeroom from {time=9} to {time=14.} Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group. I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at {time=19:30}, right before we returned to our world.": '未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。',
        "My future self merely has to be here at 19:30. ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at 14:00.{w} My past self was in the storeroom from 9:00 to 14:00. Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group.{w} I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at 19:30, right before we returned to our world.": '未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。',
        "My future self merely has to be here at 19:30. ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at 14:00. My past self was in the storeroom from 9:00 to 14:00. Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group. I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at 19:30, right before we returned to our world.": '未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。',
        "My future self merely has to be here at 7:30 p.m. ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at 2 p.m.{w} My past self was in the storeroom from 9 a.m. to 2 p.m. Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group.{w} I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at 7:30 p.m., right before we returned to our world.": '未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。',
        "My future self merely has to be here at 7:30 p.m. ...It's not exact, but I'll say the search happened at 2 p.m. My past self was in the storeroom from 9 a.m. to 2 p.m. Immediately after I left it, the fake wall was found by this world's group. I thought that in the worst-case scenario, I could enter through the storeroom after the attack. ...But that's not possible. As soon as it was found, Sai marked it, and I know that mark will still be there at 7:30 p.m., right before we returned to our world.": '未来的我只需在{time=19:30.}待在这里就够了。……时间未必精确，但搜查大约是在{time=14.}。{w}从{time=9}到{time=14.}，过去的我一直待在储藏室。我刚离开那里，这个世界的众人就发现了那面假墙。{w}我原以为，最坏的情况下，还能在袭击之后从储藏室进入……但那已不可能。假墙一被发现，Sai 就在上面做了标记，而我知道，就在{time=19:30}、也就是我们即将回到自己的世界之前，那个标记仍然还在。',
        "Knowing all that, it wasn't possible that a future self of mine would enter the tower after the 14:00 search.": '既然清楚这些，未来的我就不可能在{time=14}的搜查之后进入这座塔。',
        "Knowing all that, it wasn't possible that a future self of mine would enter the tower after the 2 p.m. search.": '既然清楚这些，未来的我就不可能在{time=14}的搜查之后进入这座塔。',
        "More importantly, it's very unlikely this would be possible either way. I shouldn't assume that I could enter through the storeroom without being seen. Technically, I could enter after {time=19:30} and travel to the past in order to be at the center of the building at the right time, but I don't know whether I'll be seen outside, and if I am, I'll be unable to travel back. I shouldn't go back to the 30th with a plan that could fail, so I have to entirely rule out the storeroom.": '更重要的是，无论怎么看，这都极难办到。我不能假定自己能不被人看见就从储藏室进去。严格来说，我可以在{time=19:30}之后进入，再穿越回过去，好在恰当的时刻待在大楼中央；但外面会不会有人看见我，我并不知道，一旦被看见，就没法再穿越回去。{w}我不能带着一个可能失败的方案回到三十日，所以储藏室这条路必须彻底排除。',
