        "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at {time=19:30}, he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom. Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at {time=14}?": '也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？',
        "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at 19:30, he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom.{w} Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at 14:00?": '也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？',
        "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at 19:30, he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom. Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at 14:00?": '也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？',
        "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at 7:30 p.m., he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom.{w} Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at 2 p.m.?": '也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？',
        "That meant that for a future self of mine to be present at 7:30 p.m., he would've had to be in the tower since a time before my past self had begun to wait in the storeroom. Since I was aware of that, how could I avoid being found by the search at 2 p.m.?": '也就是说，未来的我若要在{time=19:30}出现在这里，就必须在过去的我开始守候于储藏室之前，就已经待在塔里了。{w}既然我清楚这一点，又怎么可能躲过{time=14}的那场搜查？',
        'When could I have used the Future Sekimeiya to not be present at 14:00?': '我可能在什么时候用过未来Sekimeiya，才能让自己在{time=14}不在场？',
        'When could I have used the Future Sekimeiya to not be present at 2 p.m.?': '我可能在什么时候用过未来Sekimeiya，才能让自己在{time=14}不在场？',
        'A cue. If I had a loop in my head, I could know whether it could be completed. If I thought about everything that I would do after touching the Past Sekimeiya, I could observe whether a cue I intended to leave would exist.': '一个提示。{w}只要脑中存着一个循环，我就能知道它能否成立。若我把触碰过去Sekimeiya 之后要做的每一件事都想清楚，便能观察自己打算留下的那个提示是否存在。',
        'What about entering through the storeroom after 19:30 and then traveling to the past? Could that be possible?': '那在{time=19:30}之后从储藏室进入，再穿越回过去呢？这能办到吗？',
        'What about entering through the storeroom after 7:30 p.m. and then traveling to the past? Could that be possible?': '那在{time=19:30}之后从储藏室进入，再穿越回过去呢？这能办到吗？',
        "If it is, I'll go back in time to a point after 14:00 and leave a mark beneath that drawer. If I need to, I'll travel back twice in order to make it to a point prior to now.": '若能办到，我就穿越回{time=14}之后的某个时刻，在那个抽屉底下留下记号。如果有必要，我会连续穿越两次，回到比现在更早的时点。',
        "If it is, I'll go back in time to a point after 2 p.m. and leave a mark beneath that drawer. If I need to, I'll travel back twice in order to make it to a point prior to now.": '若能办到，我就穿越回{time=14}之后的某个时刻，在那个抽屉底下留下记号。如果有必要，我会连续穿越两次，回到比现在更早的时点。',
        "I was growing nervous. Miiya was alive—success must've awaited me. ...But could I be sure of that? It was a guarantee that Miiya was alive, but what about Shiroya? The circumstances around her were what left room for doubt.": '我渐渐不安起来。Miiya 还活着——等待我的本该是成功。{w}……可我能确定吗？{w}Miiya 活着是确凿的，但 Shiroya 呢？她那边的情形，才留出了疑问的余地。',
        'But... the situation is the same later. I saw what happened to the Sekimeiya. Sai, Akaro, and Katei moved them back and forth, but I remember it clearly—no place where the Future Sekimeiya was hidden was accessed by a future self of mine. My line of sight unconsciously blocked myself.': '可是……之后的情形也一样。Sekimeiya 的遭遇我都看在眼里。{w}Sai、Akaro 和 Katei 把两个 Sekimeiya 搬来搬去，可我记得很清楚——未来Sekimeiya 藏身过的任何一处，都不曾被未来的我碰过。我的视线在不知不觉间，把自己挡在了外面。',
        "Katei did go a long time to the future, but even if I were to enter his travel's range, I wouldn't go past 14:00.": 'Katei 确实向未来穿越了很长一段，但即使我进入他穿越的范围，也到不了{time=14.}以后。',
        "Katei did go a long time to the future, but even if I were to enter his travel's range, I wouldn't go past 2 p.m.": 'Katei 确实向未来穿越了很长一段，但即使我进入他穿越的范围，也到不了{time=14.}以后。',
        '...I felt lost. How the hell could I accomplish anything?': '……{w}我茫然无措。这样下去，我究竟能做成什么？',
        "Traveling to the future before the attack won't be doable, and after the 30th, Ashiya already had the Sekimeiya. The days up to the 15th are useless. It was the owner of that gem shop who found the Sekimeiya. On the 30th, it's very likely they were in that box I saw... But they were taken by the man who released the smoke, and he ran away with them.": '赶在袭击之前穿越到未来行不通，而30号之后，Sekimeiya 已经落到芦屋手里了。15号之前的日子都没有用。{w}找到 Sekimeiya 的，是那家宝石店的店主。30号那天，它们很可能就在我看到的那只箱子里……{w}可它们被那个释放烟雾的男人抢走了，他带着它们逃了出去。',
        "I know the smoke was released thanks to the news report I saw, so I can't obtain the Sekimeiya and save Miiya together. Not to mention that to appear in the tower on the 15th, I would also have to be there on the 15th of November. I'm sure that after the man ran away with the box, he was caught. That's what Katei told us about, and it's the reason why the Sekimeiya returned to Ashiya. There's nothing I can do there.": '我看到的新闻报道说烟雾被释放了，所以我没法既拿到 Sekimeiya 又救下 Miiya。何况，要在15号出现在塔里，我就得在11月15日待在那里。{w}我确信那个男人带着箱子逃走之后被抓了。Katei 跟我们讲的就是这件事，正因如此 Sekimeiya 才回到了芦屋。那边我插不上手。',
        "Just in case, I need to try it. A loop where I go to November 15th and remain inside the tower. Then, on November 30th, I take that box with the Sekimeiya. As fast as possible, I make sure Miiya won't die and run away. Then, I travel to the future and appear after the search that happened at {time=14.} I'll tell the police about the Sekimeiya's location before I travel so that they can find them and return them to Ashiya. If this can work, a mark will be under that drawer.": '以防万一，我得试一试。{w}一个循环：我先去11月15日，留在塔里。然后在11月30日，拿走那只装着 Sekimeiya 的箱子。{w}我要尽快确保 Miiya 不会死，然后逃走。接着穿越到未来，出现在{time=14.}那次搜查结束之后。{w}穿越之前，我会先把 Sekimeiya 的位置告诉警方，好让他们找到后归还给芦屋。{w}如果这能行得通，那只抽屉下面就会有记号。',
        "Just in case, I need to try it.{w} A loop where I go to November 15th and remain inside the tower. Then, on November 30th, I take that box with the Sekimeiya.{w} As fast as possible, I make sure Miiya won't die and run away. Then, I travel to the future and appear after the search that happened at 14:00.{w} I'll tell the police about the Sekimeiya's location before I travel so that they can find them and return them to Ashiya.{w} If this can work, a mark will be under that drawer.": '以防万一，我得试一试。{w}一个循环：我先去11月15日，留在塔里。然后在11月30日，拿走那只装着 Sekimeiya 的箱子。{w}我要尽快确保 Miiya 不会死，然后逃走。接着穿越到未来，出现在{time=14.}那次搜查结束之后。{w}穿越之前，我会先把 Sekimeiya 的位置告诉警方，好让他们找到后归还给芦屋。{w}如果这能行得通，那只抽屉下面就会有记号。',
        "Just in case, I need to try it. A loop where I go to November 15th and remain inside the tower. Then, on November 30th, I take that box with the Sekimeiya. As fast as possible, I make sure Miiya won't die and run away. Then, I travel to the future and appear after the search that happened at 14:00. I'll tell the police about the Sekimeiya's location before I travel so that they can find them and return them to Ashiya. If this can work, a mark will be under that drawer.": '以防万一，我得试一试。{w}一个循环：我先去11月15日，留在塔里。然后在11月30日，拿走那只装着 Sekimeiya 的箱子。{w}我要尽快确保 Miiya 不会死，然后逃走。接着穿越到未来，出现在{time=14.}那次搜查结束之后。{w}穿越之前，我会先把 Sekimeiya 的位置告诉警方，好让他们找到后归还给芦屋。{w}如果这能行得通，那只抽屉下面就会有记号。',
