        "Does this mean that I can't be here at 19:30? But that's the single guaranteed way I have to go back!": '这就是说，我不能在{time=19:30}待在这里？可那是我唯一能确定回去的办法啊！',
        "Does this mean that I can't be here at 7:30 p.m.? But that's the single guaranteed way I have to go back!": '这就是说，我不能在{time=19:30}待在这里？可那是我唯一能确定回去的办法啊！',
        '...Maybe there was no way to skip the 14:00 search, but what about another way around it?': '……也许{time=14}那次搜查是没法跳过的，但换个方向绕开它呢？',
        '...Maybe there was no way to skip the 2 p.m. search, but what about another way around it?': '……也许{time=14}那次搜查是没法跳过的，但换个方向绕开它呢？',
        'The Atsuki from this world looked at the rooms in hallway A. Then, I took his place and looked through the rest of the crystal floor. Finally, Miiya and I completed all the other floors.': '这个世界的 Atsuki 查看过 A走廊的房间。之后我接替他，把水晶层剩下的地方查了一遍。{w}最后，我和 Miiya 把其余楼层都查完了。',
        "Could my future self have told him to react that way? ...Word by word? I didn't think that was how it worked; his reaction seemed completely genuine. Likely, the only way for me to make such a thing work would've been by considering it before seeing his reaction.": '未来的我有没有可能教过他那样反应？……一字一句地教？{w}我觉得事情不该是这样运作的；他的反应看起来完全是真心的。恐怕，我要真想促成这种事，唯一的办法就是在他做出反应之前先想到这一点。',
        'What if she saw me? What if my future self was in the partitions on that floor? Could he have told her to not reveal him?': '如果她看见我了呢？如果未来的我就躲在那层楼的隔间里呢？{w}他会不会嘱咐过她别把他暴露出来？',
        "Well, is that so? I did notice a while ago that there's something special about the offices on the fourth floor... I'm pretty sure that nobody ever looked at them—neither in the morning nor later in the day. Miiya was the only person to inspect them. I spent the day following everyone to know where to be in a future loop.": '哦，是这样吗？我先前就注意到四楼的办公室有些特别……{w}我敢说，不管是早上还是后来，都没人去看过那里。只有 Miiya 检查过。为了弄清未来的循环里该待在哪里，我一整天都跟着所有人。',
        '...It had to be at 19:30. I was fairly certain about that.': '……必须是在{time=19:30.}。这一点我相当确定。',
        '...It had to be at 7:30 p.m. I was fairly certain about that.': '……必须是在{time=19:30.}。这一点我相当确定。',
        "I don't think that's possible, though. I would've had to be there before Naomi unlocked the attic. When I looked through the cameras, I saw that our past selves were right behind her. Even then, because the range didn't reach me, I'm not sure it would've reached the kitchen. There's no way I could've been in the living room, and I didn't see my footprints anywhere.": '可我觉得那不可能。我得在 Naomi 打开阁楼之前就待在那里。我看监控时，看到过去的我们就跟在她身后。{w}即便那样，因为范围没有覆盖到我，我也不确定它有没有延伸到厨房。我不可能待在客厅，而且哪里都没看到我的脚印。',
        'My thoughts went back to the search at 14:00.': '我的思绪又回到了 {time=14.} 的那次搜索。',
        'My thoughts went back to the search at 2 p.m.': '我的思绪又回到了 {time=14.} 的那次搜索。',
        "Why? I knew my future self couldn't have been there. So, then, what could she have seen?": '为什么？我明明知道未来的我不可能在那里。{w}那么，她究竟看到了什么？',
        "...I suppose it's not. Only one part of that is correct. It doesn't have to be me, but the only reason I can do it is that I'm not from this world. Only someone who isn't from this world can divert this world's history from their own. That's a better way to put it.": '……恐怕不是。那句话只有一半说对了。{w}未必非我不可，但我之所以能做到，只是因为我并非来自这个世界。只有不属于这个世界的人，才能让这个世界的历史偏离其原本的轨迹。这么说才更准确。',
        "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world. And... at {time=19}, the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic.": '说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。',
        "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world.{w} And... at 19:00, the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic.": '说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。',
        "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world. And... at 19:00, the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic.": '说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。',
        "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world.{w} And... at 7 p.m., the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic.": '说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。',
        "That's... right. I'm not the only person who can do this. It can be anyone from another world. And... at 7 p.m., the Shiroya from my world will appear here and go to the attic.": '说得……没错。能做到这件事的不止我一个，任何来自其他世界的人都行。{w}而且……到了 {time=19}，我那个世界的 Shiroya 会出现在这里，然后前往阁楼。',
        "I can tell her what I've learned. I can tell her everything. ...If she went to the past and saved this world, would she be able to be here at 19:30?": '我可以把我查到的一切告诉她，全部告诉她。……如果她回到过去，救下这个世界，她还能在 {time=19:30} 出现在这里吗？',
        "I can tell her what I've learned. I can tell her everything. ...If she went to the past and saved this world, would she be able to be here at 7:30 p.m.?": '我可以把我查到的一切告诉她，全部告诉她。……如果她回到过去，救下这个世界，她还能在 {time=19:30} 出现在这里吗？',
        "She couldn't have been in one of the rooms the Atsuki from this world investigated. The way he looked said more than enough. ...That means there's only one other possibility, but it doesn't make sense either. It doesn't make sense.": '她不可能出现在这个世界的 Atsuki 搜查过的任何一个房间里。他当时的神情已经说明了一切。……那就只剩下另一种可能，可那也说不通。{w}说不通。',
        "At 19:30, that's who activated one of the Sekimeiya. That's why we returned to our world.": '在 {time=19:30}，启动其中一个 Sekimeiya 的人就是他。所以我们才回到了自己的世界。',
        "At 7:30 p.m., that's who activated one of the Sekimeiya. That's why we returned to our world.": '在 {time=19:30}，启动其中一个 Sekimeiya 的人就是他。所以我们才回到了自己的世界。',
        "...It must be about {time=17:30.} I'll take the Sekimeiya out at {time=18:30.}": '……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。',
        "...It must be about 17:30.{w} I'll take the Sekimeiya out at 18:30.": '……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。',
        "...It must be about 17:30. I'll take the Sekimeiya out at 18:30.": '……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。',
        "...It must be about 5:30 p.m.{w} I'll take the Sekimeiya out at 6:30 p.m.": '……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。',
        "...It must be about 5:30 p.m. I'll take the Sekimeiya out at 6:30 p.m.": '……现在应该是 {time=17:30.} 左右吧。{w}我要在 {time=18:30.} 把 Sekimeiya 拿出来。',
        "It's strange... I know we'll change worlds at 19:30, so I'll take both Sekimeiya out so that can happen...": '奇怪……我明明知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 切换世界，所以我要把两个 Sekimeiya 都取出来，好让那件事发生……',
        "It's strange... I know we'll change worlds at 7:30 p.m., so I'll take both Sekimeiya out so that can happen...": '奇怪……我明明知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 切换世界，所以我要把两个 Sekimeiya 都取出来，好让那件事发生……',
        "...The news that I heard matched our world's. It was identical to how it would've been without my input.": '……{w}我听到的新闻和我们世界的一样，和我没有插手时的版本完全相同。',
        "That's what I thought as soon as I put together that I could alter this world's history. The news could remain consistent because it didn't lead to a single interpretation. I also thought that everything finally made sense—that it was the reason why Miiya had been in the tower and why Shiroya had been absent. It fit with the plan I came up with, so I thought I finally understood this world.": '我意识到自己能改变这个世界的历史时，首先想到的就是这一点。新闻报道之所以能保持一致，是因为它并未引出唯一的解释。{w} 我还以为一切终于说得通了——Miiya 之所以会在塔里、Shiroya 之所以不在，原因就在于此。这与我拟定的计划吻合，于是我以为自己终于理解了这个世界的运作。',
        "...It didn't make as much sense as I thought. After all, I saw Miiya in the tower—I saw the result of a loop before I came up with it. The news hadn't actually been the only piece of this world I'd observed. And maybe it makes real sense. ...I believe I know why I saw Miiya before I understood how she'd be saved.": '……事情并没有我想的那么合理。毕竟，我是在塔里见到 Miiya 的——在我想出那个循环之前，就已经看到了它的结果。我在这个世界观察到的东西，其实并不只有那则新闻。{w} 也许这样才真正说得通。……我想我知道，为什么我还没弄明白她将如何获救，就先见到了 Miiya。',
        'Sixty more minutes had been added to the timer. It was finally 18:30.': '计时器上又多了六十分钟。现在终于到了 {time=18:30.}',
        'Sixty more minutes had been added to the timer. It was finally 6:30 p.m.': '计时器上又多了六十分钟。现在终于到了 {time=18:30.}',
        "This is it. When the timer hits sixty minutes, it'll be 19:30.": '就是这个时刻。等计时器走到六十分钟，就到 {time=19:30.} 了。',
        "This is it. When the timer hits sixty minutes, it'll be 7:30 p.m.": '就是这个时刻。等计时器走到六十分钟，就到 {time=19:30.} 了。',
        "...! Who's here?": '……！{w} 谁在那里？',
        "Perhaps 19:30 wasn't the only time where returning would be possible. It could occur earlier too, at a time I wasn't aware of.": '也许能回去的时间并不只有 {time=19:30}。也可能更早，在我不知道的某个时刻。',
        "Perhaps 7:30 p.m. wasn't the only time where returning would be possible. It could occur earlier too, at a time I wasn't aware of.": '也许能回去的时间并不只有 {time=19:30}。也可能更早，在我不知道的某个时刻。',
        "If one of the Sekimeiya is activated before then for some reason, that'll cause the world change that could still happen. Since I know we'll return at 19:30, though, I have a pretty strong guarantee that the Past Sekimeiya won't be the one activated.": '如果在那之前，其中一个 Sekimeiya 因某种原因被激活，就会引发那场仍可能发生的世界变化。不过，既然我知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 回去，我就能相当肯定，被激活的不会是过去Sekimeiya。',
        "If one of the Sekimeiya is activated before then for some reason, that'll cause the world change that could still happen. Since I know we'll return at 7:30 p.m., though, I have a pretty strong guarantee that the Past Sekimeiya won't be the one activated.": '如果在那之前，其中一个 Sekimeiya 因某种原因被激活，就会引发那场仍可能发生的世界变化。不过，既然我知道我们会在 {time=19:30} 回去，我就能相当肯定，被激活的不会是过去Sekimeiya。',
        "And it came. Finally, I heard what I'd been desperately wishing for. Footsteps were approaching.": '它终于来了。我听见了自己苦苦盼望的声音。{w} 脚步声正在靠近。',
        "It can't be. She won't be in the tower. This is the same as before! Someone is telling me that Shiroya's fate within the tower is death. Why have so many people said that!?": '不可能。她不会在塔里。{w}这和之前一模一样！有人在对我说，Shiroya 在塔里只有死路一条。为什么这么多人都这么说！？',
        "It's not true! I've never seen her dead! That must be a mistake. She'll be fine. It's impossible that she will die in the tower. We'll make sure of that.": '不是真的！我从没见过她死！那一定是弄错了。{w}她会没事的。她不可能死在塔里，我们会阻止这种事。',
        "I am. I've been able to understand the Sekimeiya. The Future Sekimeiya made us appear where we were in the past; I believe that could be part of your confusion. The Past Sekimeiya made us appear where we would be in the future. ...And, if both ranges overlapped, the world around us would change instead.": '是真的。我已经弄懂 Sekimeiya 了。{w}未来Sekimeiya 会让我们出现在我们过去所在的位置——我想，你之所以困惑，可能也有这个原因。过去Sekimeiya 则会让我们出现在我们未来会在的位置。{w}……而一旦两个范围重叠，被改变的就会是我们周围的世界。',
        "O-Oh! ...That makes sense. That's how I came back.": '噢{w=0.2}——！{w=0.3}……说得通。原来我是那样回来的。',
        'So... what now? What will happen at 21:00?': '那么……现在怎么办？{time=21} 会发生什么？',
        'So... what now? What will happen at 9 p.m.?': '那么……现在怎么办？{time=21} 会发生什么？',
        'Wh-What? Really...? Can the past really be changed after all!?': '什、什么？真的……？{w}难道过去真的能改变吗！？',
        "That's not it. The past is set in stone. But in a different world, the past is no different from the future for us.": '不是这样。过去是定死的。{w}但在另一个世界里，过去对我们来说，和未来并没有什么区别。',
        'We can save her in this world. If you travel, you can save her. ...It has to be you, though.': '我们可以在这个世界救她。只要你穿越回去，就能救她。{w}……不过，这件事必须由你来做。',
        "That is the Past Sekimeiya. If you activate it when the timer reaches 63:14, you'll appear on November 30th. If you're there, Miiya will not die. I can't come with you, though. If you activate it, anyone in the center of the building will go back to our world. If I travel to the past too, I won't be able to be there. But, if it's you who does this, you will be. When December 15th comes, you'll be able to enter through the storeroom, and if you stay in the third partition on the fourth floor, you'll make it back to this point.": '那就是过去Sekimeiya。等计时走到 63:14 时启动它，你就会出现在 11 月 30 日。只要你在那里，Miiya 就不会死。{w}不过我没办法跟你一起去。你一旦启动它，所有位于大楼中心的人都会回到我们原本的世界。如果我也穿越回过去，就没办法待在那里了。{w}但换成你去做，你就能留在那里。等到 12 月 15 日，你可以从储藏室进来；只要待在四楼第三间隔间里，就能回到这个时间点。',
        "I-In that case, right outside it. It was snowing on November 30th, wasn't it?": '那、那就待在店门外好了。{w}11月30日那天在下雪，对吧？',
        "You'll have to be below a stone roof, where the snow won't hit you and there'll be none on the ground. Then, you'll be able to prevent Miiya from being hit by the explosion. That's not all, though. There's something else very important. Your body can't be found.": '你得待在石制屋檐下，雪淋不到你，地上也没有积雪。这样你就能让 Miiya 不被爆炸波及。{w}不过不止这些。还有一件很重要的事——不能让人发现你的身体。',
        "You'll be able to stay in the third partition on the fourth floor. I know that'll work, because after {time=14}, you'll go to the sixth floor and leave some kind of indication for me under one of the drawers. The fifth desk from the left, in the first partition. After that, you'll only need to leave momentarily at {time=15:30.} If you're in the floor 2 and 3 staircase, you'll avoid being inside the range of a travel. The range might actually reach the crystal floor, but if you're in a corner of the building a floor above, you'll avoid it. Just not in the crystal floor staircase since that's where I was at the time.": '你可以待在四楼的第三个隔间。我知道那样行得通：过了 {time=14} 之后，你会去六楼，在某个抽屉底下给我留个记号。也就是第一个隔间里从左数第五张桌子的抽屉。{w}之后，你只要在 {time=15:30.} 暂时离开一下就行。只要你在二楼和三楼之间的楼梯上，就不会落在某次穿越的范围内。范围说不定会延伸到水晶展室，但只要你待在这栋楼比水晶展室高一层的角落，就能避开。只是别待在通往水晶展室的楼梯上——那个时间点我正在那里。',
        "You'll be able to stay in the third partition on the fourth floor. I know that'll work, because after 14:00, you'll go to the sixth floor and leave some kind of indication for me under one of the drawers. The fifth desk from the left, in the first partition.{w} After that, you'll only need to leave momentarily at 15:30. If you're in the floor 2 and 3 staircase, you'll avoid being inside the range of a travel. The range might actually reach the crystal floor, but if you're in a corner of the building a floor above, you'll avoid it. Just not in the crystal floor staircase since that's where I was at the time.": '你可以待在四楼的第三个隔间。我知道那样行得通：过了 {time=14} 之后，你会去六楼，在某个抽屉底下给我留个记号。也就是第一个隔间里从左数第五张桌子的抽屉。{w}之后，你只要在 {time=15:30.} 暂时离开一下就行。只要你在二楼和三楼之间的楼梯上，就不会落在某次穿越的范围内。范围说不定会延伸到水晶展室，但只要你待在这栋楼比水晶展室高一层的角落，就能避开。只是别待在通往水晶展室的楼梯上——那个时间点我正在那里。',
