        "With the suitcase in hand, I descended to the lobby and sat on the floor. Then, I put the Sekimeiya inside it and placed both of my hands on them. I suddenly realized a key had fallen from my pocket before I'd even taken it out willingly...": '我提着行李箱下到大厅，坐在地上。随后把两个 Sekimeiya 放进去，双手按在它们上面。{w}我这才猛然发觉，一把钥匙从我口袋里掉了出来——我甚至还没主动掏过它……',
